iew_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-08-30T20:28:51Z","updated_at":"2024-08-30T20:34:09Z","body":"Executing the code example (without the 'name' column and auto_increment on default)  with a recent MySQL version results in the following compiled SQL:\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE user (\r\n        id FLOAT NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\r\n        PRIMARY KEY (id)\r\n)\r\n```\r\nwhich results in an OperationalError when executing the SQL on the database since recent versions of MySQL do not support AUTO_INCREMENT on FLOAT anymore.\r\nSo Postgres seems to be not the only dialect affected.\r\nIt might have been not reported before, since using FLOAT as a primary key is very rare and not recommended.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/2322290676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bgiebl","id":62909413,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTA5NDEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62909413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl","html_url":"https://github.com/bgiebl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgiebl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":14087558228,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOCX5JB86U35clzwAAAANHrxRU","url":"https: